d draft, not the saved data.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows couple names, formatted date Jun 12 2027, $40,000, 120 guests, Planning Progress 0% progressbar, and \\\"0 saved\\\" counts for Venues/Vendors/Checklists cards\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue card e.g. Rosewood Garden Estate: type \\\"Garden\\\", price \\\"Luxury ($$$)\\\", \\\"Napa Valley, CA\\\", rating 4.9, summary, \\\"Up to 200 guests\\\". Vendor card e.g. Eternal Moments Photography: \\\"Photography\\\", \\\"Luxury ($$$)\\\", \\\"Los Angeles, CA\\\", 4.9, summary, specialties Candid Shots / Drone Photography / Same-Day Edits.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"6 checklists: Planning (12+ Months Before, 8-10 Months Before), Ceremony Planning, Reception Details, Wedding Attire, Honeymoon Planning — ≥1 per required category. Expanded each; every task has a title plus explanatory description (e.g. Honeymoon \\\"Check passport validity — Ensure passports are valid for 6+ months past travel dates.\\\"). Task counts matched listed items (5-6 tasks each).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Vendors: search \\\"DRONE\\\" + Photography filter → \\\"Showing 1 of 10\\\", only Eternal Moments Photography (Photography type, has Drone Photography specialty) — satisfies both. Venues: Garden+Moderate+\\\"ocean\\\" → \\\"Showing 0 of 8\\\" with \\\"No venues match your search. Try adjusting your filters or search terms.\\\" Clearing restored full lists.\"}]}"
