    "type": "assistant_message",
    "content": "All 19 checklist items have been tested and recorded.\n\n**Summary: 14 PASS / 5 FAIL**\n\nThe core feature set works well — dashboard creation and editing, venue/vendor filtering and search, favorites, checklist browsing, task completion, and localStorage persistence all behaved as expected.\n\n**Failures found:**\n\n1. **CS-8** — Budget validation absent. Values of `0` and `-500` save without error and overwrite the previously saved budget (displayed as \"$0\" and \"$-500\").\n\n2. **CS-9** — Guest count validation absent. `-10` saves and displays as \"Guest Count -10\".\n\n3. **CS-11** — Wedding date validation absent. A past date (2020-03-15) saves and replaces the valid future date; the countdown line silently disappears.\n\n4. **IX-12** — Listing detail views are entirely non-functional. Both \"View Details\" (venues) and \"View Profile\" (vendors) are inert: no navigation, no dialog, no DOM change.\n\n5. **IX-19** — Cancel does not discard the draft. The dashboard values are correctly preserved, but reopening the editor re-displays the cancelled draft rather than the last saved values — so a subsequent Save would silently commit data the user had rejected.\n\nThe three constraint failures share a root cause: the wedding details form performs no validation before persisting, so any invalid input destroys valid saved data."
  }
}
